摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: a pasted animated GIF or WebP keeps playing in the UI, and the model receives a labelled sheet of frames sampled across the animation.","id":"gh:1418856689","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-read-animation","slug":"NeoHotaru/dsh-read-animation","topics":["animated-gif","animation","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","gif","multimodal","sharp","vision","webp"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: a pasted animated GIF or WebP keeps playing in the UI, and the model receiv"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"es a labelled sheet of frames sampled across the animation."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-read-animation"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness plugin that lets the agent **actually see an animated GIF**."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`read_image` on a GIF gives the model one picture — the first frame — and no\nsignal that the other f"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"rames existed. This plugin decodes every frame and hands\nthe model a labelled sequence of real frame"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"s sampled across the animation's\ntimeline."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## The problem"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness normalizes every stored image to a single-frame 8-bit sRGB\nraster before it reaches"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" a model, and it does this to animations too.\n`@deepseek-ai/dsh-attachment-local` excludes `image/gi"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"f` from its pass-through\npath and re-encodes through a pipeline that never sets `animated` or `page`"},{"id":"p7s4","text":", so\n`sharp` returns page 0 and the rest are dropped on the floor."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Measured, on this machine, against an 8-frame GIF:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"No layer above the read step can repair this. By the time a vision plugin, an\nimage router, or the L"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"LM adapter sees the image it is already a single frame —\nwhich is why the growing ecosystem of DSH v"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ision plugins\n(`dsh-multimodal`,\n`dsh-mmroute`,\n`dsh-vision-mix`,\n`dsh-tool-plus`, …) all say they\n\""},{"id":"p10s4","text":"support PNG/JPEG/WebP/GIF\" without any of them showing you motion. The\nanimation is still intact in "},{"id":"p10s5","text":"exactly one place: the file. So the tool lives\nthere."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Animated PNG has the same disease with a worse prognosis: libvips 8.18.7 does\nnot read `acTL`/`fcTL`"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"/`fdAT` at all, reports an APNG as a one-page PNG, and\nsilently discards every frame after the first"},{"id":"p11s3","text":". This plugin detects that case from\nthe chunk stream and refuses it by name instead of returning fr"},{"id":"p11s4","text":" plugin detects that case from\nthe chunk stream and refuses it by name instead of returning frame 0."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Two ways in, both handled"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Pasting into the chat box.** That path is already clean on the browser side: the\npaste handler han"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ds the clipboard's own `File` straight to the upload path, and\nthat path encodes `image/gif` and `im"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"age/webp` unchanged (`imageMediaType()`\naccepts both and returns them as-is) — no canvas, no `drawIm"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"age`, no `toBlob`.\n**The bytes reach the Host whole.** The Host normalizes them through\n`attachments"},{"id":"p13s5","text":".saveImages`. In DSH 0.2.2 this happens during upload, so prompt\nadmission receives an already-store"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"SH 0.2.2 this happens during upload, so prompt\nadmission receives an already-stored image reference."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The plugin wraps `saveImages`, captures the animation from its raw inputs, and\nstores the original a"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"nd decoded frames against the returned image reference.\nThis covers raw uploads and older encoded-pr"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"es against the returned image reference.\nThis covers raw uploads and older encoded-prompt admission:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**What you send is what you send.** Nothing is added to the message you wrote,\nand it does not turn "},{"id":"p16s2","text":" what you send.** Nothing is added to the message you wrote,\nand it does not turn into eight stills."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**And it keeps playing in the UI.** The Web UI has exactly one way to display a\ndurable image: `sess"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ion.readAttachment(id)` → the Host's\n`ctx.attachments.readImage(ref)` →\n`URL.createObjectURL(new Blo"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"b([bytes], { type: attachment.mediaType }))`. Both the\nbytes and the media type come from that one h"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ost call, and the browser animates\nwhatever it is handed. So the plugin serves the original at that "},{"id":"p17s5","text":"**display read** —\nno client plugin, no media route, no second authorization path. The single frame\n"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"in the store is only a lossy artifact of a normalizer that cannot represent\nmotion; handing back the"},{"id":"p17s7","text":" file the person actually pasted is the more truthful\nanswer to \"read this stored image\", and the ot"},{"id":"p17s8","text":"her two callers of that layer (ACP\nimage blocks, session-log export) are better with an animation to"},{"id":"p17s9","text":"r two callers of that layer (ACP\nimage blocks, session-log export) are better with an animation too."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Each captured frame carries its index and start time in its attachment display\nname (`x.gif#frame16@"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"1960ms`), which the harness renders to the model as\n`Image \"<name>\" …` — so the timing is already at"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"tached to the frames, waiting\nfor the delivery step below."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**The display path and the model's are independent**: the UI is served the\noriginal bytes by `readIm"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"age`, while the model's copy comes from\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`read_animation(path, …)` returns one text header plus one captioned image per\nsampled frame:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"…then, for each frame:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Everything the model needs to reason about *motion* is in that text: how long the\nanimation runs, ho"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"w fast it plays, whether it loops, which frames it is looking\nat, and — stated outright, because it "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"is the easiest thing to get wrong — that\nthe gaps are gaps."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Needs **DSH 0.1.3-alpha.2 or later** — see COMPATIBILITY.md for\nthe measured range, how it was measu"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"red, and what is not claimed."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Replace `web` with your profile name. Both routes are verified in a real profile:\nthe install lands,"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" `dsh plugin add` registers the bundle, and the `sharp` native\nbinary resolves from the package's ow"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" registers the bundle, and the `sharp` native\nbinary resolves from the package's own `node_modules`."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The git route copies the whole repository, tests and fixtures included, which is\nwhy npm is the nice"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"r install. (A brand-new package name goes through npm's staged\npublishing on its first release, so t"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"he version you install may briefly not exist\nyet while the registry processes it.)"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Or from a checkout:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The same spec works in the Web sidebar's Plugins page, and in Settings the plugin\nlist is read-only."},{"id":"p34s2","text":" Restart the running instance afterwards: plugin rows take\neffect on the next process, and a `link:`"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"ed checkout is loaded once at startup."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## What it will not do"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- **Video.** MP4/WebM need ffmpeg and a different decode path. Use\n`dsh-video-tools`.\n- **APNG.** No"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"t decodable by the host image library; refused with an explanation\n(see above).\n- **Read a static im"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"age.** It says so and points at `read_image`. A single-frame\nGIF or WebP is answered, with a note th"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"at it is not animated.\n- **Guess.** When the sampler returns fewer frames than you asked for, the he"},{"id":"p36s5","text":"ader\nsays which ones and why."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
